{
    "word": "garniture",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "84053f14-0f2f-3454-84f2-29ec45d49da9",
                "word": "garniture",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "24d0c080-efd9-4c74-bfc5-965635dfb79e",
                        "entry_id": "84053f14-0f2f-3454-84f2-29ec45d49da9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "garnitures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4e8dd3a-bd2d-3d1e-8c43-b19b3e938db5",
                        "entry_id": "84053f14-0f2f-3454-84f2-29ec45d49da9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something that garnishes; a decoration, adornment or embellishment"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2727c5ed-68fd-4650-9260-524a4837096b",
                                "sense_id": "c4e8dd3a-bd2d-3d1e-8c43-b19b3e938db5",
                                "text": "The Countess came forward to meet them, looking more beautiful than ever. But it was not now that Emily envied her beauty;—no philosopher like a girl in love, to feel, for the time being, utter indifference to all possible pomp and garniture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c21eb83a-df37-4bc9-99ff-bca633f63893",
                                "sense_id": "c4e8dd3a-bd2d-3d1e-8c43-b19b3e938db5",
                                "text": "[…] I fancied Cuthbert's reddening face / Beneath its garniture of curly gold, / Dear fellow, till I almost felt him fold / An arm in mine to fix me to the place / That way he used."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c2d7e88-5762-4148-a871-44ce32825484",
                                "sense_id": "c4e8dd3a-bd2d-3d1e-8c43-b19b3e938db5",
                                "text": "They believed that the ladies and the gentlemen alike had covered them with endearments, were candidly, gushingly glad to make their acquaintance. They had not in the least seen what was manner, the minimum of decent profession, and what the subtle resignation of old races who have known a long historical discipline and have conventional forms for their feelings—forms resembling singularly little the feelings themselves. Francie took people at their word […] It would not have occurred to the girl that such things need have been said as a mere garniture. Her lover, whose life had been surrounded with garniture and who therefore might have been expected not to notice it, had a fresh sense of it now […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fcfd223c-6898-3dc1-b622-7bd6d3bf2489",
                        "entry_id": "84053f14-0f2f-3454-84f2-29ec45d49da9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A matching array of plate armour and its accessories"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba42e08b-e827-4217-9b7e-f651ef2bffc5",
                        "source_entry_id": "84053f14-0f2f-3454-84f2-29ec45d49da9",
                        "source_sense_description": "something that garnishes",
                        "target_lang_word": "garniture",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "garniture",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ce38eae-590e-3fc7-98ce-b80322267b06",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui est mis à une chose pour la garnir, la compléter, l’orner, l’embellir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d507c0d-fbfe-48ad-bce9-102df1bef5e4",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce38eae-590e-3fc7-98ce-b80322267b06",
                                                "text": "Là-bas, devant elle, au-dessus de la haie du jardin, elle apercevait vaguement une garniture de têtes polissonnes que des rires faisaient grimacer diversement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54bdf4c3-eb98-4395-8a4d-d51c550f1334",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce38eae-590e-3fc7-98ce-b80322267b06",
                                                "text": "Il a sur sa cheminée une belle garniture de porcelaines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de90f857-1083-4d2a-ab5e-0f3ee5f287be",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce38eae-590e-3fc7-98ce-b80322267b06",
                                                "text": "Sur la seconde des deux toiles, Alexandrine-Joséphine Dufresne, raide sous son bonnet tuyauté, trône dans un fauteuil près d’une cheminée surmontée d’une « garniture » qui existe encore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59d1f4d4-43f3-4ed8-a41a-2c0fc9d78024",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce38eae-590e-3fc7-98ce-b80322267b06",
                                                "text": "La garniture d’andrinople rouge de la cheminée ondulait par instant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c7c75e1-3f0d-426b-b95f-01c04715ff96",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce38eae-590e-3fc7-98ce-b80322267b06",
                                                "text": "La garniture d’un lit, se compose du matelas, des oreillers, du traversin, des draps, etc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a4a0c46-2e86-3145-8af9-d56da962ef7b",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Assaisonnement ou accompagnement d’un plat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86ea3a6f-13b8-418d-9b80-bf3449f41200",
                                                "sense_id": "3a4a0c46-2e86-3145-8af9-d56da962ef7b",
                                                "text": "On fait accompagner d'une sauce choron les fonds d'artichaut qui doivent servir de garniture à des noisettes de mouton ou à des tournedos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9827459b-937f-3c0e-9915-7dda35febb21",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui se met à une chose pour la renforcer, pour la faire durer plus longtemps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92cb0e64-0031-4127-9bec-99166423169a",
                                                "sense_id": "9827459b-937f-3c0e-9915-7dda35febb21",
                                                "text": "La garniture d’un chapeau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1f8af05-b957-3635-b696-329478c34b1d",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accessoire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5dab1b7-feb4-4142-915c-721b6b00ad0d",
                                                "sense_id": "c1f8af05-b957-3635-b696-329478c34b1d",
                                                "text": "Elle prend un chapeau, en ébouriffe un peu le ruban, puis tient la garniture de roses de ce chapeau près de sa figure, devant la glace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41c13010-3274-4603-8e2d-f4b772999180",
                                                "sense_id": "c1f8af05-b957-3635-b696-329478c34b1d",
                                                "text": "Une garniture de dentelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8543b0ff-4f60-4773-92f4-baa4fb2cdb3b",
                                                "sense_id": "c1f8af05-b957-3635-b696-329478c34b1d",
                                                "text": "Une garniture de boutons d’or."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1932a408-b1f8-3bba-b717-950c6d038f15",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Un des divers morceaux de bois ou de métal dont on se sert pour séparer les pages et former les marges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dc87a42-0bd6-473c-b104-fedc1f92d8ac",
                                                "sense_id": "1932a408-b1f8-3bba-b717-950c6d038f15",
                                                "text": "Garniture de bois."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ebaf5c3-c3ad-46a6-ad93-6f6df6e66355",
                                                "sense_id": "1932a408-b1f8-3bba-b717-950c6d038f15",
                                                "text": "Garniture de fonte."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c5cde55-f865-3ab1-91b0-53be12a6f19a",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui recouvre une pièce mécanique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "672262b0-54d6-4877-a65a-0538ca658efb",
                                                "sense_id": "4c5cde55-f865-3ab1-91b0-53be12a6f19a",
                                                "text": "Les rouleaux de cardes sont munis de garnitures qui sont des bandes de tissus ou de cuir dans lesquels on a bouté de fines pointes d’acier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5b3ee65-e0e3-44cc-a831-48228925769d",
                                                "sense_id": "4c5cde55-f865-3ab1-91b0-53be12a6f19a",
                                                "text": "Garniture de frein."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ae709c4-1022-4be1-901b-e29330948f47",
                                                "sense_id": "4c5cde55-f865-3ab1-91b0-53be12a6f19a",
                                                "text": "Garniture d’embrayage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "484287ff-0094-3d62-b3fd-e0af9691408e",
                                        "entry_id": "112e88d4-19ff-31aa-8a91-ad9b9ff5e100",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce servant à assurer l'étanchéité d’une pompe tout en permettant les mouvements nécessaires, comme la rotation de l’arbre de la pompe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Hydraulique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64f9adff-dc9c-479d-b62d-ed213abac436",
                        "source_entry_id": "84053f14-0f2f-3454-84f2-29ec45d49da9",
